  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It’s spring here in the United States, which, for millions of people, means allergy season. While you may be feeling lousy because your immune system is busily attacking allergens left and right, that same heightened state of alertness may have benefits for your overall health. Your immune system might be hard at work defending you against pollen and dust, but it could also be defending you against certain cancers. For more on that and on foods that can help reduce allergy symptoms, visit the </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/allergies/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">allergies topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Recipe: Sweet Potato Taquitos</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/sweet-potato-taquitos/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-86452\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/potato-taquitos-2-1-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Sweet potatoes, black beans, and spices are the stars of this Daily Dozen-inspired meal. Taquitos are excellent as a handheld main dish or a party-pleasing appetizer. Get the free recipe </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/sweet-potato-taquitos/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and watch a video on how they’re made on our </span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CVBhvxcJcV0/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instagram</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Volume 58 Out Now</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-86456\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/vol-58-download-artwork-en.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>My new volume of videos is out now. This collection includes videos on hair loss, chemotherapy, an extended series on the sugar and meat industries’ influence on health and dietary guidelines, and more.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Each video in this new volume will be released online over the next few months, available for free, of course, but if you don’t want to wait, you can stream all of them </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">right now</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are a $15+ monthly supporter and opted in to our</span> <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/rewards/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">donor rewards</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, you’re likely an expert on these new topics by now, since you already received a complimentary link to the new download. If you’d like early access to new videos before they’re available to the public, please consider becoming a </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?mc_cid=1b9efb2a80&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">monthly supporter</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Without your generosity, we wouldn’t be able to continue our work.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Thank you!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">And, remember, if you watch the videos on </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NutritionFacts.org</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, you can access captions in several different languages. To find yours, click on the settings wheel in the lower-right corner of the video and then “Subtitles/CC.” Happy viewing!</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Introducing Our New Intro Page</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-86446\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/explore-mock-sq-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>In the 11 years since I started NutritionFacts.org, our library of resources has grown immensely. To help newcomers navigate all of our offerings, we just launched the brand-new Explore NutritionFacts.org page. Word of mouth from you, our devoted fans and subscribers, is one of the greatest ways people learn about NutritionFacts.org, so we hope this new page is a useful and shareable resource for you, as well. </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Volunteer Spotlight: Jason Pooler</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-86448\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/may-vol.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"267\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/may-vol.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/05/may-vol-540x720.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>I help create citations for the articles Dr. Greger uses in his videos. I love evidence-based medicine and am driven to help make sure that nutrition information is accurate and free of marketing hype. Dr. Greger’s stance on facts and information that is free of conflicts of interest inspires me to keep helping in any way I can.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There are so many plant-based recipes I enjoy. One of my favorites is a tofu or edamame poke bowl because of how versatile they are. You can easily change the ingredients but still end up with a reliably delicious and filling meal. On top of that, they are super easy to batch cook and store for a quick grab-and-go lunch or dinner.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"380\" height=\"123\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 380px) 100vw, 380px\"/></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/blocking-the-cancer-metastasis-enzyme-mmp-9-with-beans-and-chickpeas/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-74508\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans-960x540.jpg\" alt=\"jars of various legumes and beans\" width=\"216\" height=\"122\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-13-Blocking-the-Cancer-Metastasis-Enzyme-MMP-9-with-Chickpeas-and-beans.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 216px) 100vw, 216px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/blocking-the-cancer-metastasis-enzyme-mmp-9-with-beans-and-chickpeas/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Blocking the Cancer Metastasis Enzyme MMP-9 with Beans and Chickpeas</span></a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Which legumes are best at inhibiting the matrix metalloproteinase enzymes that allow cancer to become invasive?</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/ultra-processed-junk-food-put-to-the-test/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-74537\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test-960x540.jpg\" alt=\"top view of fast food meal\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/03/57-16-Ultra-Processed-Junk-Food-Put-to-the-Test.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/ultra-processed-junk-food-put-to-the-test/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ultra-Processed Junk Food Put to the Test</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> What happened when ultra-processed foods were matched for calories, sugar, fat, and ﬁber content in the first randomized controlled trial?</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-much-cancer-does-processed-meat-cause/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-73093\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause-960x540.jpg\" alt=\"greasy bacon on a hot pan\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/02/57-11-How-Much-Cancer-Does-Processed-Meat-Cause.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-much-cancer-does-processed-meat-cause/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Much Cancer Does Processed Meat Cause?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> I quantify the risks of colon and rectal cancers from eating bacon, ham, hot dogs, sausage, and lunch meat.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"p10\"><b>In health,</b></p>\n<p class=\"p10\"><b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p class=\"p10\">PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"s13\"><b>here</b></span></a> and watch my live presentations:</p>\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li11\"><span class=\"s14\">2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"s1\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></span></a></span></li>\n<li class=\"li11\"><span class=\"s14\">2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"s1\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></span></a></span></li>\n<li class=\"li11\"><span class=\"s14\">2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"s1\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></span></a></span></li>\n<li class=\"li11\"><span class=\"s14\">2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"s1\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></span></a></span></li>\n<li class=\"li11\"><span class=\"s14\">2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"s1\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></span></a></span></li>\n<li class=\"li11\"><span class=\"s14\">2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"s1\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></span></a></span></li>\n</ul>"
